empty input: RangeError
two bytes: RangeError
length past the end: RangeError
length under five: RangeError
no closing nul: RangeError
length short of the elements: BSON::Error::BSONDecodeError
unterminated key: RangeError
string length past the end: RangeError
string length zero: BSON::Error::BSONDecodeError
string without its nul: BSON::Error::BSONDecodeError
string not UTF-8: EncodingError
int32 cut short: RangeError
int64 cut short: RangeError
double cut short: RangeError
ObjectId cut short: RangeError
boolean of 2: BSON::Error::BSONDecodeError
binary past the end: RangeError
nested document past the end: RangeError
unknown type 0x20: BSON::Error::UnsupportedType
